A('- M4 covers one recipe on two hosts (penguin and box1), two builds each, with equal compiler versions. It does not show that Rust builds cannot be made reproducible: the diagnostic suggests an unremapped build path and a build id in this recipe; the flags are frozen and were not changed. It also does not show that C builds reproduce on other hosts beyond these two.')
